# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Every value below is OPTIONAL. With none set, the platform runs fully offline
# (in-memory graph, rule-based NER, TF-IDF RAG, template LLM, local storage).
# Set a group of variables to transparently upgrade that component.
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in what you need.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- API ---
API_HOST=0.0.0.0
API_PORT=8000

# --- Neo4j Knowledge Graph ---
# NEO4J_URI=bolt://localhost:7687
# NEO4J_USER=neo4j
# NEO4J_PASSWORD=your-password

# --- Groq LLM (risk narration, clause rewriting) ---
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_xxx
# GROQ_MODEL=mixtral-8x7b-32768

# --- Fine-tuned Legal-BERT (NER + 15-category classifier) ---
# ENABLE_TRANSFORMERS=1
# LEGAL_BERT_MODEL=nlpaueb/legal-bert-base-uncased

# --- ChromaDB vector store ---
# ENABLE_CHROMA=1
# CHROMA_PATH=./storage/chroma

# --- AWS S3 storage (contract PDFs, analysis reports) ---
# AWS_BUCKET=my-legal-contracts
# AWS_REGION=us-east-1
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=xxx
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=xxx

# --- Celery async processing ---
# CELERY_BROKER_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
# CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND=redis://localhost:6379/1
